Native arm64e data authentication for Swift 5.9.2 (system Swift runtime).

Backport/adapted sources:
  b22057e63737162fe29ccc262c5f60dc0089f7c6 (VWT, merged PR #74625)
  2359f281d244de1d8830b2a473937b9f2af7e1bd (coroutine prototypes, open PR #30413)
  68fbc7debc00ca5cb065e65f0aab8c49235ff122 (yield-type discriminator cache)
  swiftlang/swift PR #93528 at 3ace1f8c94e27945dae239ab646125dd39dba029
    (unmerged proposal; applicable 5.9.2 IRGen paths validated separately).

Uses a private schema helper instead of introducing new switches/options.
Class-ro signing is deliberately excluded. Newer Twc/global-block emission
paths absent in Swift 5.9.2 and its disabled read-only static-object path are
not backported. Requires the paired LLVM 16 retcon coroutine patch.
See the recorded commit audit for per-commit scope.

